    {
      "source": "Invokes the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a>s for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> results one by one and returns the first non-empty one.",
      "translation": "依次调用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a> 以生成 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> 结果，并返回第一个非空的结果。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Applies the given function to the elements of the source and returns the first non-empty result.",
      "translation": "将给定函数应用于源元素，并返回第一个非空结果。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>function</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>function</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Invokes the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> is present or the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Runnable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Runnable</code></a> if not.",
      "translation": "如果该 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.util 中的\"><code>Optional</code></a> 存在，则调用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.util.function 中的\"><code>Consumer</code></a>；否则调用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Runnable.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.lang 中的\"><code>Runnable</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"Pair.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Pair</code></a> if both <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> instances have values or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a> if one or both\nare missing.",
      "translation": "如果两个 <a href=\"Pair.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的类\"><code>Pair</code></a> 实例都有值，则返回一个 <a href=\"Pair.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Pair</code></a>；否则，如果其中一个或两个缺失，则返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Optional</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invokes the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiConsumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiConsumer</code></a> if all given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> are present.",
      "translation": "如果所有给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.util 中的\"><code>Optional</code></a> 都存在，则调用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiConsumer.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>BiConsumer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the next element of the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a> in case there is no next\nelement.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a> 的下一个元素；如果没有下一个元素，则返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Turns the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> into a one-element <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> or an empty one if not present.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> 转换为包含一个元素的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a>，如果不存在则转换为空流。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether any of the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a>s is present.",
      "translation": "返回给定的任意一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Optional</code></a> 是否存在。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Maps the values contained in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> if both of them are present.",
      "translation": "如果两个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> 都存在，则映射其中包含的值。",
      "count": 2
